  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/o96DIP6ayLc/maxresdefault.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>RyanNotBriann 官方 Minecraft 戰爭總部模組包</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><strong>必須安裝 Optifine 才能遊玩！</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;遊戲特色</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 以戰爭為主題的模組包，內含豐富的盔甲與武器可供遊玩</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 可投入戰場的各種載具&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 防禦道具，協助保護你的基地&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 導彈與核武，將戰爭體驗提升至全新層次</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;- 失落城市地圖，提供嶄新的戰場環境&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://shockbyte.com/branding/logos/shockbyte_logo_light.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"510\" height=\"116\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o96DIP6ayLc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
